444:We show that \ssfull parameterized by the number of items $n$ does not have generalized kernel of bitsize $\Oh(n^{2-\varepsilon})$ for any $\varepsilon > 0$, unless \containment. We prove the lower bound by giving a linear-parameter transformation from \erbds. \bmp{We use \erbds rather than \rbds as our starting problem for this lower bound because it will simplify the construction: it will avoid the need for `padding' to cope with the fact that vertices are dominated multiple times.}
