codex
Rejected honestly; no generator is shipped.

The planted exact-edge-weight clique family passed local G/V checks and four attacks, but failed H: the oracle pool solved every rung, including `hard` (`n=56`), using the intended additive-potential/negabinary shortcut. The mandated harness verdict was `too_easy`.

Full evidence and paper analysis: [REJECTED.md](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2107.02554/REJECTED.md). The harness-owned [.meta.json](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2107.02554/.meta.json) retains the verdict and run metadata. The rejected generator and non-shipping transcript were removed to prevent accidental use.
